{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女團少女時代（少時）隊長泰妍今日宣布展開第7次亞洲巡唱，她將於明年1月15及17日在首爾奧林匹克體操競技場舉利3場演出，之後會於1月30及31日在澳門開騷，而香港場將於3月27及28日在紅磡體育館舉行，雖然過往曾有韓流拼盤騷在紅館舉行，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.216332+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:21:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.156787+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.156787+00:00","content_hash":"f3a7b3beb4bb263476b273d362336435d38ba1f38c640d9185b64be7ee9f2721","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}